      "parameters": {
        "content": "# SETUP\n1. Add your own credentials: Telegram, Google Gemini, Supabase, Google Drive.\n2. Supabase: pgvector table 'documents' + function match_documents.\n3. Set your Drive folder in both Drive triggers and your staff chat ID in 'Alert Staff'.\n4. Enrollments: create a Google Sheet with a tab 'Enrollments' and headers time, student_name, phone, course, telegram_chat_id, key, status; set its ID in 'Save Enrollment'.\n5. Upload a document to the folder, wait 1 minute, then message the bot.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 1300,
        "color": 7
      },
